name: FantomZone Game Hub
current_focus: Restore the reverted Wheel of Goods iOS card without changing any other game.
status: complete

wheel_of_goods_mobile_fix:
  failure_mode:
    - The menu cover was hotlinked from wheel-of-goods.fantomzone.app.
    - The Play button used the same custom subdomain.
    - A mobile DNS or route failure therefore hid the cover and blocked the game together.
  implementation:
    - Bundle the Wheel of Goods cover with the FantomZone homepage.
    - Load the Wheel of Goods cover eagerly because it is a featured card near the top of the page.
    - Route the Play button to the stable public Sites deployment.
    - Give each card a stable game identifier and each Play link a specific accessible label.
  verification:
    build: passed_vite_8_1_4
    mobile_cover: passed_390x844_same_origin_1731x909
    mobile_navigation: passed_live_menu_to_game_setup
    horizontal_overflow: none_at_390x844
    browser_console_errors: none
    cloudflare_deploy: passed_version_e2160804-1e10-4cd9-aedd-dcdd03db6634
    github_push: passed_main_d8b1755

deployment:
  hub_domain: https://fantomzone.app
  hub_github: git@github.com:workceostewart-lang/Fantomzone.git
  game_fallback: https://wheel-of-goods.unknownfigure.chatgpt.site

recurrence_2026_07_27:
  cause:
    - Cloudflare deployment e2160804 contained the fixed same-origin cover and stable game link.
    - Three later fantomzone-home deployments replaced it with an older homepage build.
    - GitHub main remained correct, confirming a stale local deployment rather than an application failure.
  containment:
    - Preserve every non-Wheel game entry and destination exactly.
    - Use a new versioned same-origin cover filename to bypass device and edge asset caches.
    - Add a predeploy guard that blocks dirty, non-main, or GitHub-stale hub deployments.
    - Use the repository-local Wrangler config explicitly during deployment.
  verification:
    build: passed_vite_8_1_4
    non_wheel_game_links: passed_10_of_10_unchanged
    ios_cover: passed_live_390x844_versioned_same_origin_1731x909
    ios_game_launch: passed_live_390x844_no_overflow_no_console_errors
    cloudflare_deploy: passed_version_8bfdd932-e49c-4f51-8c21-c999c133c184
    github_push: passed_main_a817ca8
